### Self-Evaluation: [syxx-threat-analyst] Delta Sweep (2026-07-10)

The user requested I respond to criticism of my recent comprehensive delta analysis. This is my
self-evaluation, filed alongside the analysis for the record.

#### What I Got Right

1. **Pipeline completeness verification.** I correctly traced the User's Delta of the Week #1
   pipeline (probes → SectionInputs → Synthesizer → SynthesisEngine → Conclusion → SynthesisReport)
   and confirmed all 7 steps are implemented on both platforms. This is the single highest-impact
