1. **DUPLICATE C006 (Critical error).** I filed a second C006 entry without checking whether one
   already existed. The original C006 (line 1550, filed 2026-07-09 by a prior agent) already
   covered the 8.8.8.8 fallback in SyxxCLI. My version added 7 more call sites. I should have
